<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Email verification</title>
</head>
<body>
<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <h2 style="color: #333;">VERIFY YOUR EMAIL</h2>
    <p>Thank you for creating an account. To complete your registration, please use the verification code below:</p>
    <div style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 15px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #2c3e50; letter-spacing: 2px;">{{Code}}</h3>
    </div>
    <p>This code will expire in 30 minutes.</p>
    <p>If you didn't create an account, please ignore this email.</p>
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">This is an automated email, please don't reply.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>